{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのー...、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タコライスにタコ入ってないって本当ですか...('・ω・`)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/19/6303491/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"骨痛いって前回のブログに書いたらく、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方に心に心配していただきました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、一晩経った今も痛いの。ほね。なんでかね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうちょっと痛みが続くようなら病院いってみます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいパフォーマンスのためにもね☆ららら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日コメント返し"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新生活に関するコメント返し"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すたーと☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/19/6303491/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は僕も今日(4/13)誕生日!!もちろん祝ってくれるよね!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんと同じ日に18歳になることができて嬉しい限りですな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/19/6303491/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は4/13は俺の誕生日でもあったんだよ♪(^▽^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとうございます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4/13生まれの方、ひめきゅんさんの中だけで3人も出会ってしまった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こりゃあもう。あれです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"運命っw(°O°)w!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/19/6303491/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日が3日違いだったので、日芽香さんの所に初コメしてみましたw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/19/6303491/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4/16は俺の誕生日(^Q^)/(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとうございます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人は同じ誕生日なのかな?それともひめたんを挟んだ前後(ω)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どちらにせよ素敵だね。こんな奇跡もあるもんだね!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/19/6303491/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月18日なんです。ひめたんと5日違い。運命感じなぁ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これまた近いですねえ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとうございます(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な1年になりますように、お互い頑張りましょうね♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとうございます!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/19/6303491/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2月25日が誕生日だったんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今更ながらひめたんにもお祝いしてもらえたらめちゃ×2嬉しいです(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あああ。お祝い。もちろんしたい気持ちは山々だけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今おめでとうしてもいまいち感動が起きないしょ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから来年のお誕生日まで大事にとっておきますよ＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/19/6303491/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京での暮らしはもう慣れたカナ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/19/6303491/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京に引っ越して周りの環境に慣れてきたかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/19/6303491/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京の暮らしなはなれましたかな!?まだ早いか(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/19/6303491/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上京してみてどうですかぁ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/19/6303491/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"都民生活はどうですかー??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"慣れてきましたよ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気付けば1ヶ月たってた。新しいとこ来たら、それだけ新しい出会いとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい発見とかあって、ひめたんの脳はもんのすごい勢いで刺激されてるの!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/19/6303491/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京での生活どんな感じ☆?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しいっ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京生活も楽しいし、高校生活も楽しいから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「東京高校生活」なんて組み合わせ最高に楽しい(o>ω<o)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/19/6303491/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホームシックになったらいつでも広島弁でコメントするけえ、ゆうてね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああ嬉しい(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島人はじゃんじゃん広島弁でコメントして下さーい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これでひめたん寂しくなくなるね☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/19/6303491/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京の地下鉄は複雑で分かりづらいけど、ひめたんは慣れたカナ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地下鉄もばっちしですよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかゆーて、この前友達と2人して乗る電車間違えて迷子んなった('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだやんな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/19/6303491/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京に出てみて通じなかった言葉や標準語やと思ってた言葉ってあるー?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/19/6303491/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーに伝わらなかった方言ってある???"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「はぶてる」...拗ねるって意味なんだけどね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"漢字あると思って変換しようとも試みたけど、方言なんだね('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}